# Build context hygiene. Without this the 24 MB corpus arrives alongside a
# 600 MB virtual environment and a node_modules tree, and the build is slow for
# no reason.
.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.vite/
*.egg-info/
model/.cache/
model/fabric/fabric-samples/

# Local state. The world is rebuilt on boot.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Not needed at run time.
**/tests/
docs/
*.md
!DEPLOY.md
